als to chase?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"7b26d86cdfb2c0de6cb55279e15e7972","i":"5299a1aae6b4bba6112341b4911ddc74","r":"6028218:7065032:805:3675951","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6028218","7065032","805"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"A nuestro gato no le gusta perseguir ratones.","e":"Our cat doesn't like to chase mice.","s":"tatoeba","x":"21263ab3357b1640b4719fde05a4c81e","i":"624cce06bd45edeafb0b4797c9ae0a4c","r":"13935948:13935752","c":"carlosalberto","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/13935948","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/13935948","b":"Tatoeba sentence #13935948 by carlosalberto; English translation #13935752 by Ioan_Cristian","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/13935948","tu":1,"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Ya no tengo más tiempo para perseguir a ese estúpido polaco.","e":"I don't have any time to chase down that stupid Polack.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"aafec88e689251569cd52058de5c7c9b","i":"24e88d62d3bb29973b868b10758909c4","r":"5580076:6690178:176:2270739","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5580076","6690178","176"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"¿Cómo es que perseguir palomas va a ayudarme con mi entrenamiento?","e":"How's chasing pigeons gonna help me with my training?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"eee0e43e32f6d39e2e4cdcf821ab9a03","i":"e5bbaae055f3667abbf896d27647f5d7","r":"5616030:7059160:127:3308607","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5616030","7059160","127"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Tu trabajo era perseguir a Marines borrachos y desobedientes.","e":"Your job is to chase after drunk sailors and wayward Marines.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"bd8963ba7968110a6b80ad9e85756b9e","i":"1d9f2b1f2a3ab270b4c7290c0e762de3","r":"6405916:6924288:675:4006997","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6405916","6924288","675"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"¿Por qué nos molestamos en perseguir a este tipo?","e":"Why are we bothering to chase this guy?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"3dcfbfe1b9c0dc761cf86d663e47c7ff","i":"b699441c610c9ca88d1de4c7c81fad0d","r":"5197746:6602309:742:1609764","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5197746","6602309","742"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Aunque ya no lo soy, a veces, aún los ayudo a perseguir a los malos.","e":"Even though I don't do it anymore, sometimes I still help them chase the bad guys away.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"6cd573dbf9a75f8ab454213ad03c7c7b","i":"b96cb0edbad784be759120932f000d46","r":"4549122:6614074:369:783489","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4549122","6614074","369"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Tú mismo lo dijiste, tenemos que perseguir cada pista sin importar lo arriesgado que sea.","e":"You said it yourself, we need to chase every lead no matter how risky it is.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"be50192f99ac3c5f67826d1d9fa77437","i":"7238933f41a76275fe921a7c11bdc303","r":"6140708:6859216:338:3751695","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6140708","6859216","338"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Ellos le van a perseguir, señora. ¡De Verdad!","e":"They will chase her, Madam. Really!","s":"opensubtitles","x":"a04f9d78c66f86b9bb3d3d026e641967","i":"728265d27f1ce698dbcf613f05cdddf7","r":"5216810:6780149:1007:1663487","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5216810","6780149","1007"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"A mi perro le gusta perseguir ardillas.","e":"My dog likes chasing squirrels.","s":"tatoeba","x":"0415c3340d13c504d67feba78495819d","i":"21ee2b56557750160c2a3eaf2ca1be22","r":"2908068:2517279","c":"marcelostockle","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2908068","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2908068","b":"Tatoeba sentence #2908068 by marcelostockle; English translation #2517279 by Hybrid","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2908068","tu":1,"w":["tuple",0]}],[]]},"7adb4478":{"m":[[{"t":"Lo que digo es que ellas siempre te persiguen.","e":"I mean, they'll always haunt you.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"12373f2ac2818c76d8de59806b1d4e08","i":"84568f2cc570d5529b637c9371805f38","r":"5728520:6819152:370:2447491","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5728520","6819152","370"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"No siempre son nuestras acciones, sino sus consecuencias las que nos persiguen.","e":"It's not always our actions, but their aftermath that haunt us.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"591a917223c4c7c7f79436e898a52c97","i":"d479b740421934828040c44958f9a6cc","r":"6090452:6790469:175:2720020","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6090452","6790469","175"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"No sé por qué nos persiguen.","e":"I don't know why they're after us.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"35d9600609722f1f9ebd63d5e267982b","i":"1f55809db2f1c5c51deda0eac65d1c6e","r":"3896198:7060619:186:2994854","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3896198","7060619","186"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Quizá tus malas decisiones te persiguen.","e":"Maybe your bad decisions really are behind you.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"cb83f88e9b504832e1bc1cdf25f697d0","i":"5bd15b8a2b2a28ae00f890cf3d578266","r":"5791238:6936566:29:2498126","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5791238","6936566","29"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"¿Por qué nos persiguen a nosotros?","e":"Why are they coming after us?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"04c5e866948866f374a42c1edc0147c2","i":"6493dd43a280b7ecfcad5b5cc7b6b7b5","r":"4864932:6759324:1072:1178913","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4864932","6759324","1072"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"¿Por qué te persiguen estos tipos?","e":"Why are these guys after you?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"0665cee317fcaf8925f15c77ab8d5b09","i":"c66261b606dfb0e928ae20f0dddcbb21","r":"5781798:7047712:333:3442482","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5781798","7047712","333"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Algunas personas solo persiguen el placer.","e":"Some people pursue only pleasure.","s":"tatoeba","x":"4f7bda007bcf191f8e6832f2a4175dcc","i":"e8a86397a0c36f42eb7e15717217eeba","r":"336553:22297","c":"kylecito","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/336553","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/336553","b":"Tatoeba sentence #336553 by kylecito; English translation #22297 by CK","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/336553","tu":1,"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Pero ellos no lo persiguen.","e":"But they didn't pursue it.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"8b8b7da8faaa3fa421ff0adb32eb9adc","i":"6f79c14c979c0d5e7b0f557c085a2893","r":"5431472:6543043:854:2025815","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5431472","6543043","854"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"También me persiguen a mí.","e":"They're after me, too.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"0c53e79f224e3784ce1880703bf4709b","i":"f1f2f35614eb80e4f3acf2335f8ecc94","r":"3393786:6855952:896:284475","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3393786","6855952","896"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"- Es a mí a quien persiguen.","e":"It's me whom they are after.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"2a34f286c69edad53174e0a1b7301eef","i":"877f03b61d1e5172878e7e02eaf35cc1","r":"4741774:6923060:932:1026467","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4741774","6923060","932"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Muchas cosas me persiguen.","e":"A lot of things haunt me.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"d98291d3986a1ef30dcc094e2a25e856","i":"0557e8fdac779ef40d86eec59413d9a3","r":"6074546:6791933:317:2707363","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6074546","6791933","317"],"w":["tuple",0]}],[{"t":"No, porque unos tipos con armas nos persiguen.","e":"No, because guys with guns are chasing us.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"2101bfdaccdfaf1b83e40540b93c4171","i":"03643b198ec52a7f68a4179c4dc3db83","r":"1472584:6838147:570:28938","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["1472584","6838147","570"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Excepto que tú eres la razón por la que me persiguen.","e":"Except you're the reason that they're chasing me in the first place.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"036181c7