gunos persiguen el dragón.","e":"You see, uh, some, right... chase the dragon.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"3bb694d7ff2c7b218bc3b64e9784fad1","i":"4df4231ee8c47944bc3a3f3771d99f1f","r":"4174078:6927531:545:3014388","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4174078","6927531","545"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"¿Por qué todos nos persiguen?","e":"Why are they all chasing us?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"2881cdf3e63e80607194d59dbb7376ef","i":"cf3538b8bdd1a85a77c92a2979efc4f9","r":"2822672:6981744:677:189273","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["2822672","6981744","677"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Entonces. ¿No tienes idea de por qué esos tipos te persiguen?","e":"So you got like no idea why these guys are chasing you?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"85e5a6721f4559a31ad30361886a9da9","i":"2f076bae1a1f9e9c4edb39e854c48b0f","r":"3836530:6981920:155:414748","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3836530","6981920","155"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"¿Nos persiguen o algo?","e":"Whoa, are we being chased or something?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"df46ba7907035e0da3cc6687070fe597","i":"3abf01f1453dcf0bcd93042ebff1c15d","r":"4832610:6491336:653:1113437","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4832610","6491336","653"],"w":["tuple",0]}],[],[],[]]},"a6d82e3b":{"m":[[{"t":"¡Estoy muy emocionada por el club de lectura!","e":"I am so excited for book club!","s":"opensubtitles","x":"851047ae4e11249f0ed5475ec8ae4e94","i":"0b609c5853954676b27159831562d4c9","r":"5209208:7001882:1:1638123","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5209208","7001882","1"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Estoy emocionada, y vamos a estar en vivo muy pronto.","e":"I'm jazzed and we're going to be live very, very soon.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"dc2c75dab8d81c32336f62c8df9da1e3","i":"20853c79864954e5732ce7860b0f090e","r":"4000956:6824199:1682:466542","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4000956","6824199","1682"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"¿No te diste cuenta que ella estaba muy emocionada?","e":"Didn't you notice that she was very excited?","s":"tatoeba","x":"7a7a03a6ad87aa10b2e0c62d2e12b033","i":"2920ceccb0439e8b4d86085352ebfb76","r":"735832:308414","c":"darinmex","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/735832","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/735832","b":"Tatoeba sentence #735832 by darinmex; English translation #308414 by CK","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/735832","tu":1,"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Nunca vi a alguien tan emocionada por un sofá cama antes.","e":"I've never seen anyone so excited about a futon before.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"09c38cf3b7cd25f491c8b2af6eee3965","i":"39dc9107fe97bb932b07c38ac78c0512","r":"4680182:6993800:553:946939","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4680182","6993800","553"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"No puedo recordar la última vez que estuve tan emocionada.","e":"Oh, I can't even remember the last time I was this excited.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"6e94a7aaa2f25359548ade1e43d7b81d","i":"587d9865eab6a3ecab41063fc9cf006e","r":"5025236:6649021:24:1359801","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5025236","6649021","24"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Así que, honestamente, estoy emocionada de ser otra vez yo misma.","e":"So honestly, I'm just excited to be able to be myself again.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"f5b2c3dab8bb9c5a1e390814470c1fc4","i":"70b0ef4bcc635d010545d740c72dab42","r":"4899930:6575437:336:1220772","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4899930","6575437","336"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Oh, estoy muy emocionada por mi día especial.","e":"So me. Oh, I'm ever so excited about my special day.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"6fa502a6de48ab8e87de80c6f75ca02d","i":"84e34a25ba92c28042de9f1563608aed","r":"5205098:6468591:85:1623198","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5205098","6468591","85"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Estoy muy emocionada por este fin de semana.","e":"I'm really excited about this weekend.","s":"tatoeba","x":"553bd7acab85929edefa1437512fbc7e","i":"8a8a72711ac5ce815fcfd5ba9bfd8e13","r":"12857998:8575882","c":"mexicanhere","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/12857998","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/12857998","b":"Tatoeba sentence #12857998 by mexicanhere; English translation #8575882 by CK","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/12857998","tu":1,"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Estoy tan emocionada por lo de esta noche.","e":"I'm so excited about tonight. Yeah.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"a82c091373767af1652f808635948a11","i":"b971c0d73161c68c70724a75a689459d","r":"5569138:6677980:336:2259334","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5569138","6677980","336"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"¿Porqué está tan emocionada de ver el interior de la casa otra vez?","e":"Why is she so excited about seeing inside the house again?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"dec40dbc60965acb56a8200bd725eedd","i":"c07728721efaa3435582097f1f20c206","r":"2948078:6584435:373:206209","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["2948078","6584435","373"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Está emocionada por el programa de esta noche.","e":"She's excited about tonight's show.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"f5d11f4e694634b22adeaa95f3cb2529","i":"cc3f9475156711c6a6e4fa41a7e42bee","r":"6076182:6759662:296:2709323","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6076182","6759662","296"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Bueno, ella está emocionada, no le puedo hacer eso.","e":"Well, she's so excited, I can't do that to her.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"0ec9529960537a0f270917ed64ad2dba","i":"e4371472bedb0a437b6262b2dc9c3957","r":"6527026:6904884:87:4081922","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6527026","6904884","87"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Miren a quién encontré y está emocionada de que hayamos ofrecido nuestra ayuda.","e":"Look who I found, and she's thrilled we've offered our help.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"4f5920b597596a6531b2796a213de3dd","i":"3b434076827c2f6d4e07dce1a89282b7","r":"5584096:6770485:312:2281970","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5584096","6770485","312"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Lo sé, no digo que no esté emocionada.","e":"I know, I'm not saying I'm not excited.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"f670d7bf2c8df60a3d29708224fdd813","i":"8a1569abc6d73a9934a3cbc3738b4d5f","r":"1183374:6819699:1022:6161","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["1183374","6819699","1022"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Y, sin embargo, no pareces emocionada.","e":"And yet, you don't seem excited.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"604348fafcb96a7bf5cbc1c9ec0c18a4","i":"33643d2f5f4263bfab34a0b8362ed081","r":"5524586:6952307:10:3237494","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5524586","6952307","10"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Ella estaba emocionada por su presencia.","e":"She was thrilled with his presence.","s":"tatoeba","x":"dcfa216b24e197864a88089111abe921","i":"600e41b5f514a944e9d4abe5925aef95","r":"1646081:316198","c":"marcelostockle","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1646081","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1646081","b":"Tatoeba sentence #1646081 by marcelostockle; English translation #316198 by \\N","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1646081","tu":1,"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"La gente no parece emocionada, ¿eh?","e":"People don't seem excited, huh?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"0976de1c85e053f7ee4697d74ee02b03","i":"615eee82d160399f51c25e403e742ce8","r":"6140640:6807734:519:2767528","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6140640","6807734","519"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"De todos modos, debes estar emocionada.","e":"Anyway, you must be excited.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"e07051052044a35d203c833b2e38b3c8","i":"8260405c96a0991db4d7e679de898e2f","r":"6493146:6947845:109:4063728","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6493146","6947845","109"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Estoy tan emocionada que podría gritar.","e":"I'm so excited I could just scream.","s":"